# Wave T24 (Eldergrove register): the Flower Clock — Eldergrove's
# signature, standing at the heart of its bed in the SE garden
# where the shipped clock sign has always stood. A petal-ring
# clock face in full bloom (pink/violet outer petals, gold inner
# ring, cream face) with two dark hands — it blooms on the hour,
# so the hands stand at twelve and three. Short post, leaf base.
# (WAVE-T24-ELDERGROVE-PLAN.md, Prop register.)
PIX tile-prop-flowerclock 16 16
